<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freüntlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grueß</unclear>, unnd diennst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovor</unclear>, Edle,
